{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"## MAIN IS GREEN -- verified, not assumed\n\nBranch-head run 33875177644 at sha 1af45065465e (contains 2618, confirmed by merge-base ancestry):\n  conclusion: SUCCESS\n  sweep (macos, full suite)      success   <- this was THE red\n  build-and-test / pytest x4     success   (ubuntu 3.11/3.12/3.13, macos 3.13)\n  sweep py3.14 / py3.14t / py3.15 / declared-lower-bound / external-doc-links   success\n  only non-success: sweep (windows), which is continue-on-error and cannot affect a conclusion\n                    (never-green informational job, ticket f850, awaiting an operator decision)\n\nI checked the specific job rather than accepting the top-level conclusion, because earlier tonight I\ndeclared main healthy off the four pytest cells and missed a regression in the sweep tier -- which was\nthis very bug. The verification cost one dispatch and one check; the earlier shortcut cost several\nhours of main being red without my noticing.\n\nTHE ARC, worth recording as one line: main went red on a regression introduced by MY OWN merged\nchange (2600's toolchain test surfaced a fixed 5s bound in the repo-isolation git probe that sits\ninside the runner's latency distribution), the cause was established on evidence rather than\nelimination, the fix took three patchsets because it touches a helper every test calls, and main is\nnow green on a sha that provably contains it.\n\nPRIMARY JOB STATE: GREEN. The only failing CI job anywhere on main is the informational Windows sweep,\nwhich has never passed since it was added on 2026-08-26 and is filed with its disposition fork stated.\n\nTotals so far tonight: TEN changes merged, SEVEN tickets closed, six orphan bugs filed with\nreproductions, and two repo-wide CI blockers cleared (9a17 by my change, 90c7 by the operator's\nrevert)."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788528430381593001,"uuid":"ba34ad72-e229-4787-842a-e40d2f378c45"}